  {
   "start_phrase": "If you've been watching",
   "line": "If you've been watching the percentage fall and wondering whether the update damaged your battery, it almost certainly didn't. You can check that yourself in about ten seconds. I'll show you where to look, what the phone is doing in the meantime, and, at the end, how to tell when it has actually finished, which is the part nobody seems to mention.",
