  {
   "start_phrase": "Apple explains this",
   "line": "Apple explains this on its own support page about battery life. It says that even though you can use your device immediately after an update, certain tasks related to the update keep running in the background. Those tasks, it says, can affect battery life and thermal performance. So if your iPhone has been running warm as well, you're seeing the same thing.",
