   "line": "You'll see very specific figures elsewhere: three to five days, about four days, twenty-four to forty-eight hours. I tried tracing them back, and I couldn't find a test, a measurement or an Apple page behind any of them. One of the few outlets that went looking put it plainly: every confident number circulating that week came from somewhere other than Apple.",
